* chain_read_d1 -- MECHANISM PROBE, row table-nested-subscript-cost (FINDING-2026-08-21-s199).
* ISOLATES: single-hop table READ cost, pre-built table (no creation/IDENT in the timed loop), key
* cycles through 8 pre-seeded slots so the read cannot be trivially loop-hoisted.  Leaf VALUE TYPE is
* INTEGER -- this is the depth-1 rung of the chain_read_d1/d2/d3 ladder (same leaf, same slot cycle,
* only hop count differs) and also the INTEGER control for value_type_tbl.sno's boxing isolation.
        &STLIMIT = -1
        ZCHK = 20
        ZBUD = 500
        ZFLR = 20
        level1 = TABLE()
        slot = 0
seed1   level1[slot] = slot * 3
        slot = LT(slot, 7) slot + 1                     :S(seed1)
        DEFINE('ZBODY(ZKN)')                            :(ZBODY_END)
ZBODY   ZKN = ZKN + 0
        ZI = 1
        total = 0
        slot = 0
ZBL     total = total + level1[slot]
        EQ(slot, 7)                                      :S(zreset)
        slot = slot + 1                                   :(zcont)
zreset  slot = 0
zcont   ZI = LT(ZI, ZKN) ZI + 1                           :S(ZBL)
        ZBODY = total                                     :(RETURN)
ZBODY_END
-INCLUDE '../../benchmarks/snobol4/harness.inc'
